परि-√ 1. धा P. Ā. -दधाति, -धत्ते, (pf. -दधुर्, -दधिरे; fut. -धास्यति; aor. -धात्, -धीमहि; ind.p. -धा॑य; Ved. inf. प॑रि-धातवै॑),
to lay or put or place or set round, RV. &c. &c.;
to cast round, turn upon (दृष्टिम्, with loc. Hariv.);
to put on, wear (with or sc. वासस्), dress, VS.; AV.; ŚBr. &c.;
 surround, envelop, enclose, RV. &c. &c.;
to conclude or close (the recitation of a hymn), TS.; Br. :
Caus. -धापयति (ind.p. ˚यित्वा, Pāṇ. vii, 1, 38, Sch.), to cause a person to wrap round or put on (2 acc.), Br. &c.;
to clothe with (instr.), AV. :
Desid. -धित्सते, to wish to put on MBh.

परि-√ धाव् P. -धा॑वति (ep. also ˚ते), to flow or stream round or through, RV.; Suśr.;
to run or drive about (with मृगयाम्, ‘to hunt’), MBh.;
to run or move round anything (with acc.), AV.; MBh. &c.;
to run through or towards or after (with acc.), MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -धावयति, to surround, encircle, MBh.
